      ],
      "extract": "As noted, developing strategies and programmes that are tailored to the needs of the specific community or PrEP user population presents the best opportunity for high quality, client-centred care. The entry point into planning and development of this approach is familiarity with community needs. As part of continuous quality improvement cycles, programmes should consult with community stakeholders to determine the",
