      "extract": "This method was developed to address the challenges of informing the choice of PrEP, developing a plan for adherence, and developing broader plans for sexual health (17). The method is interactive, brief, client-centred and focused on problem-solving, starting with the client’s identification of personal goals and the barriers and facilitators to achieving those goals. The method was developed for the iPrEx study",
