      "extract": "Best practices in counselling are also incorporated into a PrEP counselling plan that was developed by FHI360 for a study looking at PrEP use and risk compensation among women at higher risk for HIV infection at sites in Kenya and South Africa (24, 25). More information on this approach can be found in the following document Guidance for providing informed-choice counseling on sexual health for women interested in",
